38:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"option-2-haramain-high-speed-train","children":"Option 2: Haramain high-speed train"}]
39:["$","p","p-3",{"children":["The Haramain railway connects ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"King Abdulaziz International Airport station"}]," — opened in December 2019 on a short branch from the main line — with Jeddah's Al Sulaymaniyah station, King Abdullah Economic City and ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Madinah"}],". From the airport to Madinah takes around ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"2 to 2.5 hours"}],", depending on stops."]}]
