40:["$","p","p-7",{"children":"Coach services connect Jeddah and Madinah. They are the cheapest option, but slower than driving, run to a timetable and drop you at a coach station rather than your hotel. They suit budget travellers with flexible time."}]
41:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"option-4-domestic-flight","children":"Option 4: Domestic flight"}]
42:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"Flights between Jeddah and Madinah are short, but with check-in, security and the airport transfer at each end, the total journey time is often similar to the train or a car. They make most sense if you are connecting from another flight on the same ticket."}]
